  "scientific_review": [
    "All four original January15/July15,2022 Florida/offshore Portugal cases retain all twenty original section anchors, including unselected/edge/censored primary support. Exact source positions, raw-profile and diagnosis pointers, primary lower depths and paired spans remain unchanged from pinned source artifacts. Fully unsupported cases are retained explicitly rather than forcing a projection.",
    "Florida uses fixed0degree northward with primary10cm/s andsurface>5cm/s; offshore Portugal uses fixed180degree southward with primary2cm/s andsurface>1cm/s. Both require complete native0–200m signed-integral support. All2/5/10/20cm/s diagnostic layers remain at the same selected column. Different current-specific primary cutoffs are explicit model definitions, not a universal physical boundary or interchangeable ranking metric.",
    "Florida25.5–27.5N is a partial Straits corridor with27N monitoring geography from NOAA primary search-indexed text and fresh Volkov2024 publisher context. Loop,Antilles,downstream Gulf Stream and family-level Gulf Stream System remain separate target identities. Dry/shallow lateral support and current-to-seabed contact can limit model contour closure. No last wet level,missing value or source bathymetry is substituted for a lower threshold crossing. Sv is transport,not stored volume.",
    "Existing observation-based Florida Spray fitted means and twelve annual phases remain separate from2022 snapshots. Absolute-contour censoring and half-core-decay references stay intact; model comparisons do not relabel a fitted phase as a dated observation or transfer a decay depth into physical thickness. No independent observational validation or compatible width/depth join is claimed.",
    "Portugal44–36N/20–12W is a partial offshore subset of the Martins2002 statistical box. Source15m-drogue1993–1994 means/errors are not2022 flow speeds,depth errors or annual bounds. Coastal Portugal Current,countercurrent,slope undercurrents,Azores jet and Canary continuation remain separate targets. Broad-gate southward maxima may be mesoscale/neighboring flow; named-current axis and diffuse-current representativeness remain unvalidated.",
    "Frozen v18 source-to-reference and v12 adjacent-only interpolation preserve all original gates and gaps. Only adjacent eligible originals permit assumed lower-depth interpolation; paired spans additionally require both vertical boundaries. No gate tuning,weaker interior substitution,alternate-cutoff fill,missing-value bridge,gap skipping or extrapolation occurs. Unselected midpoint geometry is explicitly unsampled. Reference connector lengths are not measured current lengths.",
    "All86 earlier supported scenarios,historical unresolved cases,every old CSV cell and canonical ownership list are preserved under cloud checks. Immutable v14 base and eleven earlier addenda remain pinned. The earlier WSC interval report is also explicitly pinned and retained,with its comparison group distinct. Inventoryv12 adds one pinned current addendum/CSV without rewriting older data or expanding a full snapshot.",
    "Eleven projection cloud tests cover all twenty anchors/four cases,source values/positions/pointers,current-specific frames/gates/cutoffs,selection and censoring gaps,unselected geometry,adjacent-only interpolation,source mutation rejection,piece/input/count integrity,earlier objects/CSV cells/ownership and no physical/annual promotion. Six canonical baseline tests passed on the same exact code commit. Source collection separately passed45 tests and audited every retained section.",
    "All retrieval,retries,profile/geometry/contour/interpolation computations,inventory reconstruction and tests ran sequentially in the cloud on one idle CPU. Local work was source text/metadata review,code preparation,hash checks and exact artifact retention. No local numerical ocean-field processing/tests or runtime/UI/browser work occurred. Field/transport/publication caps are unchanged.",
    "These dated model diagnostics are not complete physical current thicknesses,annual envelopes,independent observations or confidence intervals. No full physical route depth,matched width/depth area,physical volume,state join or global total is admitted. Remaining current coverage,observational/seasonal validation and runtime/query integration remain unfinished."
